---
source: crates/deft-cli/../../tests/unit/help.rs
expression: "help::errors()"
---
Error codes (stable). Exit: 0 ok, 1 failed, 2 usage, 3 input, 4 engine missing, 5 partial.
  UNKNOWN_COMMAND      2 No such group or command; see the suggestions
  BAD_OPTION           2 Unknown or misplaced option
  BAD_VALUE            2 An option value does not match its syntax
  INPUT_NOT_FOUND      3 An input path does not exist
  INPUT_UNSUPPORTED    3 The input format is not supported by this command
  INPUT_MISMATCH       3 The input is a different format than the command expects
  INPUT_CORRUPT        3 The input could not be parsed
  INPUT_ENCRYPTED      3 The input is password-protected
  OUTPUT_EXISTS        1 The output already exists; pass --force to overwrite
  OUTPUT_UNWRITABLE    1 The output location cannot be written
  ENGINE_MISSING       4 An external engine is required; the hint shows how to install it
  ENGINE_FAILED        1 An external engine reported an error
  NO_CONVERSION_PATH   3 No chain of converters reaches the requested format
  TARGET_UNREACHABLE   1 The requested target (such as a file size) cannot be reached
  LIMIT_EXCEEDED       3 The input exceeds a safety limit (pixels, pages, size)
  TIMEOUT              1 The operation exceeded --timeout
  INTERNAL             1 A bug in deft; please report it
